          <div class="product-toggle active-toggle">
            <button
              type="button"
              class="product-toggle__title"
              data-toggle="> div"
              aria-controls="description"
            >
              <span class="product-toggle__title-text">Description</span>
              <i class="product-toggle__title-icon product-toggle__title-icon--plus">
                <svg version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" x="0px" y="0px" width="18px" height="18px" viewBox="0 0 18 18" xml:space="preserve">
  <g fill="#000000">
    <polygon points="18,8 10,8 10,0 8,0 8,8 0,8 0,10 8,10 8,18 10,18 10,10 18,10 "/>
  </g>
</svg>

              </i>
              <i class="product-toggle__title-icon product-toggle__title-icon--minus">
                <svg version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" x="0px" y="0px" width="18px" height="18px" viewBox="0 0 18 18" xml:space="preserve">
  <g fill="#000000">
    <rect x="0" y="8" width="18" height="2"/>
  </g>
</svg>

              </i>
            </button>

            <div
              class="product-toggle__message"
              id="description"
            >
              <div>
                <p>Just like your favorite boss, our X3 provides the right mix of comfort, flexibility and ways to get the job done. Its multilayered fabric resists stains and spills and its design offers 10 adjustable ergonomic features. The X3 is for those who prefer a mesh fabric but need an extra-level of support, professionals who work from home and share a workspace, this high-end mesh is spill, stain, and water resistant allowing for easy cleanups, and anyone who runs hot and can benefit from cooling and breathable fabric to help regulate body temperature.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        

        
        
          <div class="product-toggle active-toggle">
            <button
              type="button"
              class="product-toggle__title"
              data-toggle="> div"
              aria-controls="description"
            >
              <span class="product-toggle__title-text">Features</span>
              <i class="product-toggle__title-icon product-toggle__title-icon--plus">
                <svg version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" x="0px" y="0px" width="18px" height="18px" viewBox="0 0 18 18" xml:space="preserve">
  <g fill="#000000">
    <polygon points="18,8 10,8 10,0 8,0 8,8 0,8 0,10 8,10 8,18 10,18 10,10 18,10 "/>
  </g>
</svg>

              </i>
              <i class="product-toggle__title-icon product-toggle__title-icon--minus">
                <svg version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" x="0px" y="0px" width="18px" height="18px" viewBox="0 0 18 18" xml:space="preserve">
  <g fill="#000000">
    <rect x="0" y="8" width="18" height="2"/>
  </g>
</svg>

              </i>
            </button>

            <div
              class="product-toggle__message"
              id="description"
            >
              <div>
                <ul>
                  
                  
                    <li>A.T.R. Fabric is a multilayered nylon that is both responsive and supportive, and water, spill, and stain resistant. Can easily be cleaned with hot water and soap.</li>
                  
                    <li> Cushioned Foam Seat provides long-lasting comfort with a water-fall edge allowing for ideal ergonomic positioning.</li>
                  
                    <li>4-Dimensional armrests come standard (up, down, side-to-side, front-to-back) and with the option to upgrade to FS 360 rotational armrests. </li>
                  
                    <li>SciFloat Infinite Recline + Tilt Lock and Tension allows you to recline and lock into position or increase tension in your recline motion for more fluid movement.</li>
                  
                    <li>Height Adjustable Backrest independently adjusts allowing you to raise the DVL® to fit the curve of your back. Seat depth and seat height are also adjustable features.</li>
                  
                    <li>Some assembly required.</li>
                  
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        

        
        
        
