    <div id="shopify-block-AalZoa1VuVHhXeVBwY__yotpo_product_reviews_reviews_VygQ68" class="shopify-block shopify-app-block">

  
  
    
  




<div
    class="yotpo yotpo-main-widget"
    data-product-id="8115118604570"
    data-name="X3 Management"
    data-url="https://www.xchair.com/products/x3-atr-management-office-chair"
    data-price="979.00"
    data-currency="USD"
    data-image-url="https://www.xchair.com/cdn/shop/products/2020_XChair_x3_Glacier_ATR_Headrest_NoHMT_02_Front_Right_R1_large.png%3Fv=1682282931"
    data-description="&lt;p&gt;Includes high-end mesh that is breathable, highly durable, and water and stain resistant. &lt;/p&gt;">
</div>



  
  
    <div id="yotpo-reviews-section-data" style="margin-top:4px; font-size:11px; line-height:1.35; color:#555; max-height:220px; overflow:auto; padding:6px 8px; border:1px solid #eee; border-radius:4px; background:#fafafa;">   <section id="yotpo-reviews-overall-rating">     <p><strong>Overall rating:</strong> 4.6944838 / 5 from 707 reviews.</p>   </section>   <section id="yotpo-reviews-ai-summary">     <h3>AI Generated Review Summary</h3>     <p>The X3 Management chair is highly praised for its excellent quality, breathable and durable mesh, and water and stain resistance. Customers appreciate its soft, comfortable, and adjustable seat, as well as the infinite number of adjustments that enhance comfort. The chair's easy assembly and excellent support are also highlighted, though feedback on the heat/cool/massage unit is mixed.</p>   </section>   <section id="yotpo-reviews-summary-topics">     <h3>Summary topics</h3>     <ul>       <li><span class="yotpo-topic-name">Product Quality</span> (<span class="yotpo-topic-coverage">7%</span>): <span class="yotpo-topic-summary">Customers loved the excellent quality of the chair, which was mentioned multiple times in the reviews.</span></li><li><span class="yotpo-topic-name">Seat Comfort</span> (<span class="yotpo-topic-coverage">5%</span>): <span class="yotpo-topic-summary">Customers expressed satisfaction with the seat, finding it soft, comfortable, adjustable, and adjustable.</span></li><li><span class="yotpo-topic-name">Adjustability</span> (<span class="yotpo-topic-coverage">6%</span>): <span class="yotpo-topic-summary">It was reported by customers that the chair's infinite number of adjustments greatly enhances the chair and its comfort.</span></li><li><span class="yotpo-topic-name">Ease of Assembly</span> (<span class="yotpo-topic-coverage">5%</span>): <span class="yotpo-topic-summary">Customers appreciated the easy assembly of the product, which was mentioned multiple times in the reviews.</span></li><li><span class="yotpo-topic-name">Feature Range</span> (<span class="yotpo-topic-coverage">5%</span>): <span class="yotpo-topic-summary">Customers appreciated the range of features available on the chair, finding them amazing and great bonus features.</span></li>     </ul>   </section>   <section id="yotpo-reviews-review-topics">     <p><strong>Review topics:</strong> [&quot;instructions&quot;,&quot;color&quot;,&quot;frame&quot;,&quot;problem&quot;,&quot;fit&quot;,&quot;support&quot;,&quot;comfort&quot;,&quot;work&quot;,&quot;fabric&quot;,&quot;assembly&quot;,&quot;quality&quot;,&quot;use&quot;,&quot;materials&quot;,&quot;shipping&quot;,&quot;design&quot;,&quot;service&quot;,&quot;customer service&quot;,&quot;look&quot;,&quot;feel&quot;,&quot;setting&quot;,&quot;value&quot;,&quot;husband&quot;,&quot;style&quot;,&quot;price&quot;,&quot;packaging&quot;,&quot;heat&quot;,&quot;construction&quot;,&quot;chair&quot;,&quot;improvement&quot;,&quot;height&quot;].</p>   </section>   <section id="yotpo-reviews-highlights">     <h3>Review highlights</h3>     <ul>       <li><span class="yotpo-highlight-text">&quot;The height adjustable lumbar fits and supports my back very well.&quot;</span> &mdash; <span class="yotpo-highlight-author">Ka</span></li><li><span class="yotpo-highlight-text">&quot;Easy assembly, great fit and adjustability.&quot;</span> &mdash; <span class="yotpo-highlight-author">Harold B.</span></li><li><span class="yotpo-highlight-text">&quot;Perfect height adjustment and spine support for long office meetings&quot;</span> &mdash; <span class="yotpo-highlight-author">Tudor H.</span></li>     </ul>   </section>   <section id="yotpo-reviews-individual-reviews">     <h3>Reviews</h3>     <article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="Ahmadou H." data-rating="5">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">Awesome Quality</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">&quot;Solid build. You get what you pay for. You can tell this chair is built to last. Very impressed. Very easy to put together and very comfortable.&quot;</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">&mdash; <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">Ahmadou H.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">5/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="Laure M." data-rating="5">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">A game changer</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">&quot;Absolutely amazing! It was a step up for me to invest in such a chair but when I considered I was spending 8h in front of my screen each day AND my terrible back pain I made the decision to invest.  It's been less than a week but it changed everything. I feel so good after a day at my desk now! Thank you!&quot;</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">&mdash; <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">Laure M.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">5/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="Russell W." data-rating="4">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">Very nice chair</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">&quot;Really wish the back would go up another 2 clicks, I'm just a little too tall for the highest setting, even holding at the top of the travel where it resets is too low.&quot;</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">&mdash; <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">Russell W.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">4/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="Paul C." data-rating="5">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">So far so great</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">&quot;First week in my chair and I love it. Just wish you could make the heat and massager last longer. Great quality, sturdy and my Glazier Blue color is gorgeous&quot;</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">&mdash; <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">Paul C.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">5/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="Eli D." data-rating="5">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">X-cellent chair</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">&quot;The ergonomics alleviated my back pain basically the next day. There was a stark difference in quality when comparing chair I was previously sitting in, which indicated the source of my back problem. The quality is great!&quot;</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">&mdash; <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">Eli D.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">5/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="Kenneth J." data-rating="5">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">Excellent chair!</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">&quot;Best chair I have ever purchased and looking forward to having it for many years to come. High quality, great extra features and very customizable to fit to your body. Excellent chair.&quot;</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">&mdash; <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">Kenneth J.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">5/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="Michael R." data-rating="4">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">It works</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">&quot;Ordering is a breeze, getting the expensive chair is less than exciting. It took over a week before it was in the delivery process. Assembly is easy enough. Chair is comfortable, the default wheels are nice initially but they collect dirt quickly and it builds up on them making movement cumbersome, probably should have ordered the racing wheels.&quot;</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">&mdash; <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">Michael R.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">4/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="Yanhia M." data-rating="5">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">Just as described</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">&quot;Very pleased with the chair, all the specific items that were requested to make it a custom chair were delivered as expected. The only thing I wish is that instead of having the controls for the heat, cold and massage on the back of the chair, I wish there was a remote control. The headrest adjustment is very hard, you have to apply a lot of force to move it up or down.&quot;</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">&mdash; <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">Yanhia M.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">5/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="Nancy E." data-rating="4">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">New chair</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">&quot;I think the quality of the swivel and the cushion are excellent however my suggestion is to create better armrests with less play in them and more cushion . Thank you&quot;</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">&mdash; <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">Nancy E.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">4/5</span>)</p>     </article><article class="yotpo-review" data-reviewer="Julie K." data-rating="4">       <h4 class="yotpo-review-title">Comfortable, but . . .</h4>       <p class="yotpo-review-body">&quot;With so many great features, having the controls for heat/cool and vibration out of reach seems bizarre. A remote control would be helpful as my work is interrupted every time the features shut off and I have to get up and walk around to the back of the chair.&quot;</p>       <p class="yotpo-review-author">&mdash; <span class="yotpo-reviewer-name">Julie K.</span> (<span class="yotpo-review-rating">4/5</span>)</p>     </article>   </section>   <section id="yotpo-reviews-qa">     <h3>Q&amp;A</h3>     <dl>            </dl>   </section> </div>
  



</div>
  




